=====================
RobotFramework-Random
=====================

This repository details a collection of **random utilities that can be used within tests written using RobotFramework**. As of this moment, there is no detailed documentation yet on the modules and keywords available, but the expectation is to fix this over time.

Installation and Usage
======================
**pip install robotframework-randomlibrary** should do the trick!

